{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight Island</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you build a powerful <i>Skill Deck</i> to conquer the mysterious island you\u2019ve been cast onto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/3002432ffa0f53fd918961a1be575e3f.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/3002432ffa0f53fd918961a1be575e3f.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/3002432ffa0f53fd918961a1be575e3f.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities await. Want to break the game wide open? Gather the right skills and gems to unleash absurd amounts of damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/6b14fa21f081258f5703c5edd4ccd864.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/6b14fa21f081258f5703c5edd4ccd864.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/6b14fa21f081258f5703c5edd4ccd864.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said roguelike deckbuilders can\u2019t feel impactful? With unique animations for every unit, every hit lands with weight and intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone. Companions with diverse abilities will fight by your side\u2014just find the right potions to unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>200 skill, gem, and companion cards</strong>, no two runs will ever be the same.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2785710?t=1769684755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2785710?t=1769684755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/1132d21b7d183c1a5b1d136ddfc3a96935d4a8ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769684755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/1132d21b7d183c1a5b1d136ddfc3a96935d4a8ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769684755"